      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "That means top less than or equal to bottom and left less than or equal to right.",
      "start_ms": 14660,
      "end_ms": 22160,
      "start_frame": 440,
      "end_frame": 665,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the loop, we follow the same order as our trace.",
      "start_ms": 22940,
      "end_ms": 26480,
      "start_frame": 688,
      "end_frame": 794,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Consume an edge, shrink that boundary, validate and continue.",
      "start_ms": 27180,
      "end_ms": 31960,
      "start_frame": 815,
      "end_frame": 959,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "After the top edge, we check whether any rows remain.",
      "start_ms": 32760,
      "end_ms": 36180,
      "start_frame": 983,
      "end_frame": 1085,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "After the right edge, we check whether any columns remain.",
      "start_ms": 37200,
      "end_ms": 40980,
      "start_frame": 1116,
      "end_frame": 1229,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "After the bottom edge, we check the rows again.",
      "start_ms": 41700,
      "end_ms": 44900,
      "start_frame": 1251,
      "end_frame": 1347,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "After the left edge, we do not need another separate check.",
      "start_ms": 45500,
      "end_ms": 49220,
      "start_frame": 1365,
      "end_frame": 1477,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Why?",
      "start_ms": 49840,
      "end_ms": 50380,
      "start_frame": 1495,
      "end_frame": 1511,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Because execution returns to the main while condition.",
      "start_ms": 50800,
      "end_ms": 54100,
      "start_frame": 1524,
      "end_frame": 1623,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "And that condition validates both row and column boundaries before the next round begins.",
      "start_ms": 55040,
      "end_ms": 61500,
      "start_frame": 1651,
      "end_frame": 1845,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "There is one more Python detail.",
      "start_ms": 62420,
      "end_ms": 64180,
      "start_frame": 1873,
      "end_frame": 1925,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "That is easy to get wrong.",
      "start_ms": 65000,
      "end_ms": 66280,
      "start_frame": 1950,
      "end_frame": 1988,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "When we traverse the bottom edge backwards, we use range right left minus 1 minus 1.",
      "start_ms": 67060,
      "end_ms": 74900,
      "start_frame": 2012,
      "end_frame": 2247,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "And when we traverse the left edge upwards, we use range bottom top minus 1 minus 1.",
      "start_ms": 75320,
      "end_ms": 82560,
      "start_frame": 2260,
      "end_frame": 2477,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "Python does not include the stop value in range.",
      "start_ms": 83060,
      "end_ms": 85400,
      "start_frame": 2492,
      "end_frame": 2562,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "So using left minus 1 lets us include the left boundary.",
      "start_ms": 85820,
      "end_ms": 89620,
      "start_frame": 2575,
      "end_frame": 2689,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "And using top minus 1 lets us include the top boundary.",
      "start_ms": 90340,
      "end_ms": 94960,
      "start_frame": 2710,
      "end_frame": 2849,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "These checks and reverse ranges are what protect us from off by one errors and duplicate values.",
      "start_ms": 95600,
      "end_ms": 102400,
      "start_frame": 2868,
      "end_frame": 3072,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "Every matrix cell is appended once.",
      "start_ms": 103080,
      "end_ms": 105680,
      "start_frame": 3092,
      "end_frame": 3170,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "So the time complexity is O M times N.",
      "start_ms": 106140,
      "end_ms": 111920,
      "start_frame": 3184,
      "end_frame": 3358,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "And apart from the output list, we keep only a constant number of variables.",
      "start_ms": 112880,
      "end_ms": 117740,
      "start_frame": 3386,
      "end_frame": 3532,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "So the auxiliary space is O 1.",
      "start_ms": 118420,
      "end_ms": 121820,
      "start_frame": 3553,
      "end_frame": 3655,
      "word_count": 7
    }
  ],
